**Phase 6 — finalize.** If the quality gate passed: call `backlog_task_edit` to set the task to **Done**. Use `record_git_action` (and other git tools if available) to log branch, commit, push, and PR actions per your project runbook. If the gate failed, do **not** mark Done; summarize what is needed (e.g. rollback, fix, retry).
